A kind, virtuous, and lonely creature, as well as the original creator of [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]], [[Geography/Althane/Realms/Ilkyne|Ilkyne]], and the twelve [[Geography/Althane/Realms/index|realms]]. Gave their essence to bestow the gift of life upon their creation. Their story is told in the [[Divinity/Althane/Creation Myth|Creation Myth]].
